mapping "V2830.1" source="V2830" target="214435005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V2830 = Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 V28.3 SNOMED CT 214435005, with activity-context
        (sport/exercise). Base V28.3 has Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 443050 (Noncollision motor vehicle
        traffic accident while boarding or alighting, concept_code 214435005) and 438310. is the
        role+event-specific standard target for the boarding/alighting noncollision event. The Swedish
        activity-context extension (sport/work/etc.) has no SNOMED CT representation; it is administrative
        metadata, not part of the clinical injury concept, so the SNOMED CT target fully subsumes the
        clinical meaning (broader). moderate: best available standard concept via verified Athena
        crosswalk through the base ICD-10 code, but equivalence is looser because the Swedish extension
        adds an unspecified-source dimension not independently re-verified in SNOMED CT. Granularity 5: the
        five activity-context Swedish extensions V2830/V2832/V2833/V2834/V2838 all collapse onto this
        single SNOMED CT target.
        """
}
